@@ -1,5 +1,14 @@
 # Changelog
 
+## Unreleased
+
+### Fixed
+
+- Treat PNG, JPEG and WebP inputs as stills when adding or replacing clips, even when FFprobe reports a single-frame duration. Use the requested still duration and the QImage producer.
+- Require positive still-image probe evidence instead of a filename suffix or missing duration. Preserve motion-video producers when names disagree and report unresolved video/audio timing without treating it as a still.
+- Pin the probed absolute video/audio indices when creating, replacing or relinking media. Skip attached artwork, choose the default playable streams, and disable missing streams instead of decoding an audio-first movie as a frozen frame.
+- Consume explicitly marked technical empty-track placeholders on first placement, including position zero and newly emptied tracks. Preserve intentional and legacy one-frame gaps without adding a trailing black frame.
+
 ## 1.5.6 (2026-09-12)
 
 ### Changed
